{"strongs": "H0446", "word": "אֱלִיאָב", "translit": "e.li.av", "root": "אלה", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Levite singer", "definition": "אֱלִיאָב proper name, masculine ( God is father , compare אֲבִיאֵל ) \\ \\ a. prince of Zebulon Num 1:9 ; Num 2:7 ; Num 7:24 ; Num 7:29 ; Num 10:16 . \\ \\ b. prince of Reuben Num 16:1 ; Num 16:12 ; Num 26:8 ; Num 26:9 ; Deut 11:6 . \\ \\ c. brother of David 1Sam 16:6 ; 1Sam 17:3 ; 1Sam 17:28 (twice in verse); 1Chr 2:13 ; 2Chr 11:18 (compare אֱלִיהוּ 1Chr 27:18 ). \\ \\ d. a Kohathite 1Chr 6:12 = אֱלִיאֵל v. 1Chr 6:19 compare אֱלִיהוּ 1Sam 1:1 . \\ \\ e. a Gadite 1Chr 12:9 . feminine Levite singer 1Chr 15:18 ; 1Chr 15:20 ; 1Chr 16:5 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB435')\">BDB435</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H446')\">H446</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB434')\">BDB434</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB436')\">BDB436</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֱלִיאָב</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>God is father</highlight>, compare <bdbheb>אֲבִיאֵל</bdbheb>) <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> prince of Zebulon <ref ref=\"Num 1:9\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,9)\">Num 1:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 2:7\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(4,2,7)\">Num 2:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 7:24\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(4,7,24)\">Num 7:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 7:29\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(4,7,29)\">Num 7:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 10:16\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,16)\">Num 10:16</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> prince of Reuben <ref ref=\"Num 16:1\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(4,16,1)\">Num 16:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 16:12\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(4,16,12)\">Num 16:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 26:8\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(4,26,8)\">Num 26:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 26:9\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(4,26,9)\">Num 26:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 11:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,11,6)\">Deut 11:6</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> brother of David <ref ref=\"1Sam 16:6\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(9,16,6)\">1Sam 16:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 17:3\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(9,17,3)\">1Sam 17:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 17:28\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(9,17,28)\">1Sam 17:28</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:13\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,13)\">1Chr 2:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 11:18\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(14,11,18)\">2Chr 11:18</ref> (compare <bdbheb>אֱלִיהוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 27:18\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(13,27,18)\">1Chr 27:18</ref>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> a Kohathite <ref ref=\"1Chr 6:12\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,12)\">1Chr 6:12</ref> = <bdbheb>אֱלִיאֵל</bdbheb> v.<ref ref=\"1Chr 6:19\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,19)\">1Chr 6:19</ref> compare <bdbheb>אֱלִיהוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 1:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,1)\">1Sam 1:1</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> a Gadite <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:9\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,9)\">1Chr 12:9</ref>. <b>feminine</b> <highlightword>Levite singer</highlightword> <ref ref=\"1Chr 15:18\" b=\"13\" c